00:09:42.511 --> 00:09:43.500
nickname is?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.640
- Salty soup?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.850
- Mushroom of the sea.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.397
- [Producer] America's béchamel.

00:09:49.397 --> 00:09:51.960
- Oh.
- Oh...

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.030
- We do surgery.
- Cake surgery?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:57.660
- [Rie] Can you put this cake
upside down onto this base.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:01.080
And this is a cream we made earlier.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.510
And then we gonna put jam.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:05.820
So we pipe cream in a border.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.550
So this cherry jam doesn't bleed out.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:09.630
Second layer.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.940
- [Tway] I really cannot
wait to taste this cake.

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:12.773
- [Rie] Me too.

00:10:12.773 --> 00:10:16.110
This is the ganache with
dehydrated mushroom.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.880
So we gonna decorate on top.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.010
- [Tway] Nice.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.080
- [Rie] We gonna put
fresh cherries on top.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.760
- [Tway] That is so pretty, yay!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.675
- [Rie] We have chocolate curls.

00:10:25.675 --> 00:10:27.258
- [Tway] Ah, fancy.

00:10:28.108 --> 00:10:29.275
- We are done.

00:10:30.756 --> 00:10:34.173
(bright classical music)

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:45.120
Cream of mushroom black forest cake.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.200
Very fancy.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.420
- This is super fancy.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:49.890
I can't believe we made this.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.380
- We made too much.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:55.620
So I think we have to
have our mutual friend.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.840
- Do you think he would be
able to guess what's in here?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.510
- I don't think so.
- I don't think so either.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.910
- So we have very, very special guest.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:06.300
H Woo. (claps hands)

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.523
- Are you wearing a suit?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.450
- Just for you guys.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.240
- We made a popular pantry item fancy.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.623
This is what we made.

00:11:15.014 --> 00:11:15.847
- Ah!

00:11:15.847 --> 00:11:17.700
- Ah!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.750
- Cake looks fantastic.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:19.583
- Thank you.

00:11:19.583 --> 00:11:20.417
Let's dig in.

00:11:20.417 --> 00:11:21.250
- Cheers.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.630
- Can you guess what
popular item is in this?

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.903
- Is it like the hostess
chocolate cake thing?

00:11:27.903 --> 00:11:28.736
(Tway imitates buzzer)

00:11:28.736 --> 00:11:29.569
- It's savory.

00:11:29.569 --> 00:11:30.402
We'll give you a hint.

00:11:30.402 --> 00:11:31.290
This popular item,

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.003
it's called America's béchamel.

00:11:33.864 --> 00:11:34.697
- What?

00:11:34.697 --> 00:11:36.236
(Rie laughs)
- That's really good.

00:11:36.236 --> 00:11:37.230
- I'll keep eating it, but-

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:38.190
- It's good, right?

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.023
- One more hint.

00:11:39.023 --> 00:11:39.856
It's canned.

00:11:39.856 --> 00:11:41.970
- One more hint.
(Tway laughs)

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:42.803
- It's a soup.

00:11:42.803 --> 00:11:44.460
- Oh, is it cream of mushroom?

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:45.334
- Yeah.

00:11:45.334 --> 00:11:46.167
- No way.

00:11:46.167 --> 00:11:47.280
(all laugh)

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:49.830
- Wait, there's one
more secret ingredient.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:50.667
- One more?

00:11:50.667 --> 00:11:51.870
- But it's actually sweet.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:52.860
And if you look at the cake,

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:54.210
you can tell on what it is.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:55.043
- The cherries?

00:11:55.043 --> 00:11:56.340
- Yes!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:57.173
- Canned cherries.

00:11:57.173 --> 00:11:58.620
One last things to do.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.193
Three, two, one.

00:12:00.193 --> 00:12:01.526
- Make it fancy!

00:12:03.359 --> 00:12:04.760
- [Rie] H. Woo!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.593
(whimsical music)

